Z||000014||FieroJoe||05-31-2001||10:17 AM||||Washing my Fiero is definatly a 1/2 day job!!<P>That is all I did Memorial day.  I powerwashed my engine, washed the car, cleaned the interior, detailed the engine, polished the rims, and then let it air dry completely so I could polish it.  But, when I came back, the entire car was full of yellow pollen!!!!  I mean entirely covered!!<P>Stupid pollen.  At least it comes off when you drive.  If there is a wind blowing, I can look at my pine trees and see yellow clouds of the stupid pollen billowing off and coming to attack my car.<P>Yay! 1000 posts!<BR>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/joesig_1.jpg">  <BR>'87 Coupe 5spd.<BR>AIM:FieroJoe87<p>[This message has been edited by FieroJoe (edited 05-31-2001).]||||reg||1
